{"artifact_date":"2026-08-29","formal_id":"GS-698","precedence":{"current_question_evidence":"external_runtime_authoritative","historical_context":"prior_only","history_must_not_override_current":true},"prior":{"action_gap_type":"B3-METHOD","c_followup":{"after_current_question_only":true,"eligible":true,"reason":"B2 或 B3 仅标记当前题结束后的辨型复习资格。"},"effective_representation":[{"evidence_origin":"user_observed","kind":"minimal_diagram","source_capture_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","text":"曲面本体、坐标面投影与投影维数的最小关系图曾帮助排除被压成一维的投影。"}],"evidence_origin":"user_confirmed","evidence_scope":"prior_only","first_break":{"evidence_origin":"user_observed","kind":"object_role","source_capture_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","text":"历史复做时把柱面等式当成二维投影域，并默认必须用被压缩的坐标对表示曲面。"},"hint_dependency":{"evidence_origin":"user_observed","level":"direct_explanation","source_capture_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","text":"历史上需直接区分曲面本体与投影域，并补齐隐藏坐标恢复、分支选择与偏导处理，才能完成主路线。"},"independent_correct_steps":[{"evidence_origin":"user_observed","source_capture_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","text":"历史上独立识别需要把曲面面积微元转换为二维平面微元。"},{"evidence_origin":"user_observed","source_capture_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","text":"在投影路线被指出后，历史上独立说明被隐藏坐标的符号应由原曲面所在卦限决定。"}],"needs_confirmation":false,"unresolved":[{"evidence_origin":"unresolved","source_capture_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","text":"尚未验证能否无提示独立选择有效投影、保留原曲面条件并完成建式。"}]},"schema_version":"math-teaching-context-v1","source_bindings":{"capture_bindings":[{"amendment_event_ids":[],"capture_content_hash":"f41d05c0bcc6683af68cf5a7c0d8243a0f3ff5e0de343ff34c3f72d6ec7b17a9","capture_event_id":"MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93","effective_evidence_hash":"d972fa7c56e922dfdac1a830fffc1ce8ba2622e22733378ddeeceb41027c2929","effective_target_hash":"d1474dc5b0e6b047ea814a6d837a264867038150954082b83fb761b39798951f"}],"capture_event_ids":["MFI-CAP-4caad493088a221c8e767f93"],"capture_evidence_source_version":"609adb85ab8786d8970af588f5943f95d83f3c